---
<section id="newsletter" class="rounded-[10px] overflow-hidden bg-zinc-950 text-white dark:bg-white dark:text-black">
  <div class="p-6 md:p-8 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 items-center">
    <div>
      <div class="kicker text-red-400 dark:text-brand-600">The Sunday footnote — free</div>
      <h3 class="font-display font-black text-[26px] tracking-[-0.02em] mt-1">5 viral claims, what was missing.</h3>
      <p class="text-[14px] opacity-70 mt-1">Join the 2-minute Sunday read. One creator test inside. No spam.</p>
      <div class="mt-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px] opacity-70">
        <span class="flex -space-x-2"><span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-500 grid place-items-center text-[10px] font-bold">A</span><span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 grid place-items-center text-[10px] font-bold">K</span><span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-sky-500 grid place-items-center text-[10px] font-bold">M</span></span>
        Loved by curious readers + quoted creators
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- Replace action with your beehiiv publication embed URL before launch -->
    <form action="https://beehiiv.com/subscribe" method="get" class="flex gap-2 w-full">
      <input required type="email" name="email" placeholder="you@email.com" aria-label="Email address" class="flex-1 h-11 px-3 rounded-lg text-black text-sm outline-none min-w-0" />
      <button class="h-11 px-5 rounded-lg bg-brand-500 text-white font-bold text-sm hover:bg-brand-600 shrink-0">Join</button>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>
